type: software
title: "Corpus Dedup Library"
abstract: "A corpus near-deduplication and quality-filtering library using MinHash and LSH, with a bit-exact Rust core used by default, a Python reference, and a JSONL CLI; deduplicates 1.4 million C4 documents in 30 seconds."
